      "content": "moderate risk sounds a bit vague. if the board asks specifically if there's a known vulnerability that could lead to an immediate breach or unauthorized access, can i honestly tell them \"no, we're totally fine for now\"? i just don't want to trigger a panic if it's really just a matter of updating some old protocols.",
